 	\[
 		L(x) = \sum_{j=1}^m L^{(j)}(x^{(j)})
 	\]
 	for all $x = \sum_{j=1}^m x^{(j)} \in \bigoplus_{j=1}^m V^{(j)}$, is an $\ell$-level CL function on $V$ for $\ell = \max_j \{\ell_j\}$; the maximum exists since $m \ge 1$.
